{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のコメント！\nいつもありがとーございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回もしてくださるかたもいて、\nほんとーにほんとーにうれしいです！\nそして........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新100回目"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様のおかけでblog更新ができて、100回という記録が出せました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからはもっともっと沢山更新して、皆様に沢山元気をあげれるようになりたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、2012、Jリーグオフィシャルサポーターとして、応援しに、仙台に行ってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベガルタ仙台VSサンフレッチェ広島"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イヤー！すごかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２対２で同点だったけど素晴らしいプレーを見れた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベガルタの選手はブラジル出身の背番号18のウイルソン選手は凄い活躍で、チームワークも凄かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、サンフレッチェは\n佐藤寿人選手！\nあのシュートは鳥肌ですね！\nミキッチ選手も森脇選手も"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選手みんなすごかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにサンフレッチェの試合を見て、やっぱかっこいーなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っておもった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"試合終了してすぐお兄ちゃんにメールしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度サンフレの試合見に行こー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って！\nOKでたんで、スケジュールが合えば絶対行きます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左胸の勇気を歌って踊らさせていただいて、サポーターの方もすごく暖かくて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！私が泣いてて心配してくださったかた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感極まって泣いちゃったんです。\nなんかわることがあったとかじゃなくて、嬉しかったんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配かけてすみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなかった人は是非また会いに来てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは待ってるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、メンバーで仙台をまわりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて言葉に表して伝えればいいかわからないけど、もっと災害のことを知ってもらいたいと強くおもった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなものがくずれてて、\n正直、こんなにひどいとは思ってなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パイプも電柱もへにゃへにゃにおれて、家もぐちゃぐちゃだった！\n知ってるようで知らないことが沢山あった！\n災害から一年以上たった今も！\nまだ、こうして改善されていません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、まだ悲しかったことがあります。\nテントで暮らしている人が居ました。\nこんな人がまだ沢山いる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ私たち皆で助け合わなきゃ★☆★\nもっともっとみんなの力！愛が必要だと思った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今できることを精一杯とりくんでいきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、メンバー紹介します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では期末テスト中なので、ここらへんで......(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も皆さんが幸せでありますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8596147/0014.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}